Adapted from Rakazo:
- The colour palette in web/src/index.css (from packages/ui-tokens), since
  reworked toward Apple Messages' greys and system blue.
- The menu, tooltip, popover and dialog primitives in web/src/components/ui/
  and web/src/components/kit.tsx, following packages/ui-web/components/ui.
- Message markdown in web/src/components/markdown.tsx (from packages/chat-ui):
  a copy button on code blocks, sortable tables, and links limited to
  http, https, mailto and tel.

Changes: rewritten for this app's tokens, Hugeicons and the system font, and
trimmed to what Channels uses.

